      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY


    Hold SPACE (or S / Down) to duck-dive. Let go to float
    back up.


    Watch your BREATH bar. It drains underwater and refills at the
    surface.

    Run out and you''ll be forced up!


    Dive under whitewash sets.
    Dodge seagulls, pufferfish, and rocks.


    Shells = points   White bubble =
    refill breath   Purple bubble = shield

    KITE = fly into the sky! Hold SPACE
    to climb and grab the sky shells.


    P / Esc = Pause    M = Mute ocean'
